N:Notes quantized to 16ths, pitch bends applied (scripts/midi_to_ktab.py read_tracks). Sa = C; C major apart from one passing G# (bars 30 and 156).
N:Form played by the MIDI: sthayi (first line twice, O bondhu aamar, first line); antara, sanchari and abhog, each returning to the first line; the sthayi again to end.
